&nbsp;
&nbsp;
The actor also discussed the challenge of balancing her professional commitments with her responsibilities as a mother, wife and entrepreneur. Alongside her acting career, she runs her beauty brand, Kay Beauty, and said learning to manage her different roles has become a new challenge.
&ldquo;What I am now trying to learn is how to balance being an actor, an entrepreneur, a mother, a wife, a daughter, a sister. That&rsquo;s a harder dance to master,&rdquo; she said.
Kaif also praised Kaushal for his support and involvement as a father, describing him as a partner who brings wisdom, integrity and strong family values to their relationship.
&ldquo;Vicky is an incredible husband. He is wise beyond his years, has strong family values and a true sense of integrity. I would say Vicky is wise in practice, and I am wise in theory,&rdquo; she said.
She added that one of his greatest strengths was giving her the space to be herself while remaining attentive to the family&rsquo;s needs.
&ldquo;As a father, he&rsquo;s been amazing. He has this incredible superpower to be 100 per cent present in the moment with Vihaan and me, even when he is tired and has been working 14, 16 or 18 hours a day,&rdquo; Kaif told Vogue India.
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
View this post on Instagram
